"updated_at":"2016-05-12T16:02:27Z","closed_at":"2016-05-12T16:02:27Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I'm writing a genrule that creates a .ear file by unpacking several .war files into a directory and then repacking them into a single artifact. I'm trying to use `//third_party/ijar:zipper`, but it is failing when trying to extract war files that contain subdirectories that don't yet exist in the destination.\n\nFor example, my genrule does this:\n\n```\nmkdir backend\ncd backend\n../../$(location //third_party/ijar:zipper) x ../../$(location :backend)\ncd ..\n```\n\nAnd when running it I get a failure that looks like this:\n\n```\nCannot open file /root/.cache/bazel/_bazel_root/c9fadd9098376b2dddd3da4175fdad4b/master/ear/backend/WEB-INF/web.xml for writing: Permission denied\n```\n\nIf I change `mkdir backend` to `mkdir -p backend/WEB-INF` the error goes away, but then I have to pre-create each subdirectory manually. This makes the ijar zipper not very useful for extracting archives that might contain subdirectories.\n\nI can work around this easily enough by using jar instead of ijar zipper for extraction.\n","closed_by":{"login":"bazel-io","id":15028808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDI4ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15028808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io","html_url":"https://github.com/bazel-io","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/630/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/630/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}